{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04260","headline":"在军中赠先还知己 · 骆宾王","name":"在军中赠先还知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬转俱行役，瓜时独未还。\n魂迷金阙路，望断玉门关。\n献凯多慙霍，论封几谢班。\n风尘催白首，岁月损红颜。\n落雁低秋塞，惊凫起暝湾。\n胡霜如剑锷，汉月似刀环。\n别後边庭树，相思几度攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}